{"meta":{"id":"aqua-vita-emulsion","category":"cosmetics/recipes","title":"아쿠아 비타 멀티 모이스처 에멀전","subtitle":"(100g)","summary":"마유의 고보습 장벽과 장미수 수분감을 결합한 바디 & 헤어 겸용 에멀전","tags":["에멀전","마유","보습","헤어리브온"],"color":"sky","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-aqua","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-50 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-sky-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-200/60 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></span>\n      화장품 레시피 3\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">Formulation Note</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    아쿠아 비타 멀티 모이스처 에멀전 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-sky-600 font-serif\">(100g)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-sky-50/70 border border-sky-100 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">제품 성격:</strong> 마유의 고보습 장벽과 장미수의 수분감을 결합한 에멀전 로션 (바디 & 씻어내지 않는 헤어 리브온 겸용)\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">효능 & 효과</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">마유의 불포화지방산이 형성하는 탄탄한 유수분 보호막</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">끈적함은 줄이고 흡수력은 높인 산뜻한 유수분 밸런스 케어</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">샤워 후 전신 건조감 완화 및 손상된 모발 끝 큐티클 결 정돈</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3.5 bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-amber-900 leading-relaxed\">\n      <strong class=\"font-semibold text-amber-950\">※ 주의:</strong> <span class=\"bg-amber-100/90 text-amber-950 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-bold\">두피에는 사용하지 마세요.</span> 적당량을 덜어 피부나 모발에 부드럽게 펴 바르고 두드려 흡수시켜 주세요.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-4 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">향 구성</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/70 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">아쿠아 비타 향 (총 1.0g)</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border border-stone-200/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-stone-600 mb-1.5 font-medium\">\n      <span>아쿠아 비타 <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">1.0g</strong></span>\n      <span class=\"text-sky-600 font-semibold text-xs\">단독 (약 20방울)</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex bg-stone-200\">\n      <div class=\"bg-sky-400 h-full transition-all\" style=\"width: 100%\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">전성분 배합표 & 역할</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">기준 중량: 100.0g</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[54%]\">구분 및 성분명</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 text-center w-[13%]\">용량</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[33%]\">핵심 역할</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[베이스]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">장미수</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">82.0g</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">진정 수분 베이스 (산뜻한 플루이드 제형)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[보습제]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">저분자 히알루론산 1%</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">4.0g</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">속보습 유지 및 수분 공급</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[보존제]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">1,2-헥산다이올</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">1.5g</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">저자극 천연 유래 방부 보존</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[영양오일]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">비정제 마유</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">7.0g</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">산뜻한 피부 친화적 보습 장벽 형성</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[유화제]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">올리브유화왁스</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">3.5g</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">가벼운 에멀전을 형성하는 천연 유화제</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[항산화제]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">토코페롤 (비타민 E)</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">1.0g</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">마유 산패 방지 및 피부 항산화</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/30 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-purple-700 bg-purple-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[향료]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">알러지 프리 아쿠아비타</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">1.0g</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">청량하고 산뜻한 마린 시트러스 터치</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">제작 및 활용 팁</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong>제조 방법:</strong> 수상(장미수)과 유상(마유+유화제)을 각각 65~70℃로 가열(전자레인지 30초)하여 둘을 섞은 후 블렌더로 2~3분간 유화시킨 후 식힘. 40℃ 이하에서 향료를 넣고 마무리합니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><strong>헤어 리브온 활용:</strong> 샴푸 후 타월 드라이한 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">젖은 모발 끝에 소량 발라주면 헹궈낼 필요 없는 트리트먼트로 완벽하게 기능</strong>하며 부스스함을 방지합니다.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>Natural Beauty Recipe Guide</span>\n  <span>100g Formulation Sheet</span>\n</div>\n","path":"cosmetics/recipes/aqua-vita-emulsion","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"cosmetics","title":"화장품","path":"cosmetics"},{"id":"recipes","title":"수제 레시피","path":"cosmetics/recipes"}],"hasImage":true}